  "summary": "盘六壬年廉相子宫同羊，虽武曲忌来冲，天梁禄与禄存吉辅使其强旺；癸卯天同限又得破军禄吉命，火铃夹制反被作者解释为激发作为。天同限安享或有为须先看本命强弱再看吉煞，文献出版年份不作行运，末注残缺保留。",
  "summary_en": "In Chart Six, a Ren birth has Lian Zhen and Tian Xiang with Qing Yang at Zi. Despite Wu Qu Hua Ji, Tian Liang Hua Lu and Lu Cun support are said to strengthen the configuration. In Gui Mao, Tian Tong occupies the cycle palace while Po Jun Hua Lu strengthens natal Life; flanking Huo Xing and Ling Xing are then interpreted as stimulating action. The author makes natal strength primary and other support secondary when contrasting initiative with passivity. Bibliographic publication years are not fortune cycles, and the unfinished final note remains incomplete.",
